# Compiled iverilog simulation binaries -- rebuilt by run_synth.sh, and the
# bulk of the folder's size (1 MB for mult_signed_8x8 alone).
out/*/*_sim

# Tool transcripts. Regenerated on every run; useful locally, noise in git.
out/*/*_yosys.log
out/*/*_sim.log

# The generated netlists themselves (.v, .blif, .eblif, .json), the concrete
# .ys and the stat files ARE tracked on purpose -- they are the deliverable, and
# the repo already tracks its other generated netlists under out/.
